# What never needs to reach the web.
#
# Vercel serves the repository as it is: anything here would be a real
# address on the live site. These are working files, not the shop, and
# docs/ in particular names the database. The function only ever reads
# api/, server/ and assets/js/data.js, so none of this is missed.

# the original photographs and the style references
design/

# the hosting notes, which name the database address
docs/

# run by hand on this machine, never on the server
scripts/
start.bat

# editor and project settings
.claude/
.vscode/

# a record of which names exist, of no use to a visitor
.env.example
README.md
